---
// CapitalFlowTrilemma.astro
---

<div class="my-12 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto">
  
  <div class="px-6 py-5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50">
    <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-1">Illustration 5</div>
    <h3 class="text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-medium m-0">The Capital-Flow Trilemma</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="p-8">
    <div class="relative w-full max-w-md mx-auto aspect-square max-h-[350px]">
      
      <!-- Triangle Lines -->
      <svg class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full text-slate-300 dark:text-slate-700" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <polygon points="50,15 15,85 85,85" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
      </svg>

      <!-- Top Node -->
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-2 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-900/40 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-700/50 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-center shadow-sm z-10 w-48">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-800 dark:text-indigo-300">Monetary-Policy Independence</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom Left Node -->
      <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-0 -translate-x-4 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/30 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-700/50 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-center shadow-sm z-10 w-40">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-400">Exchange-Rate Stability</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom Right Node -->
      <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-0 translate-x-4 bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-900/30 border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-700/50 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-center shadow-sm z-10 w-40 opacity-60">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-800 dark:text-rose-400 line-through decoration-rose-500/50">Free Capital Mobility</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Center text indicating the conflict -->
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-center w-3/4">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 font-bold bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-navy-900/80 px-2 py-1 rounded inline-block backdrop-blur-sm border border-slate-200/50 dark:border-slate-700/50">
          The Impossible Trinity
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-4 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800/80 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
      <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200">The policy problem:</strong> maximising all three simultaneously creates a structural constraint. India has historically chosen greater monetary autonomy and managed exchange-rate flexibility while retaining restrictions on capital mobility.
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
